    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Obsolete: use DYN] Grey, blocky to slightly fissile mudstones and sporadic thin, discontinuous silty laminae. Bioturbated. Fossiliferous. Includes a siltstone member - the Tai-herion Member."@en ;
