    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "At the lower boundary grey-white fine-grained calcareous sandstone of the Ascog member is interbedded with grey mudstone and dolomitic limestone (cementstone) of the Ballagan Formation.The boundary is picked where beds of dolomitic limestone (cementstone) are absent and sandstone becomes the predominant lithology."@en ;
