        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SEMPEL"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Strongly layered, interbedded semipelite; garnetiferous pelite (locally with kyanite and/or staurolite); micaeous psammite. Locally cm-thin calc-silicate ribs."@en ;
