    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Red fine-grained, well cemented sandstone and siltstone, either massive or with well developed bedding (cross bedding and parallel lamination). Overlying and underlying units are both red-brown silty mudstone. Unit includes harder silty mudstone lithologies indistinguishable in field."@en ;
