        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A heterolithic, lenticular unit of conglomerates, limestone layers and nodules, green clays and sandstones with some dolostones."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The base is placed at the base of green claystone and rubbly limestones (calcretes), where they overlie and infill an irregular palaeokarstic surface at the top of the underlying Gilwern Oolite Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/CJ> ;
