        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/Z"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Consolidated, red silty clay or clayey silt with pebbles to boulders of local and exotic lithologies."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Placed generally where the till overlies the clays and silts of the underlying White House Silts. Locally, the base rests on Mathon Sand and Gravel."@en ;
