    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Orthoquartzite, fawn to white; cross-bedded with pinkish haematite streaks. Thin micaceous interbeds common. Gritty in parts. Flaggy, micaceous psammites locally at top and base."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "At lower limit of persistent pasmmite or quartzite above the Mortlach Graphitic Schist Formation."@en ;
