    reg:status <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/reg-statuses/stable> ;
    skos:definition "Basaltic-rock, lava and siliciclastic argillaceous rock with subsidiary chert, dolerite, mudstone, pillowed basalt lava, rhyolitic tuff and tuff. Bedrock. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Arenig Series (Ordovician Period) - to - Llandovery Epoch (Silurian Period) (477.1-432.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
