    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Calcareous sandstone with subsidiary chert, limestone and sandy limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Late Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (378.9-359.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
