    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Usually less than one metre."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The upper boundary is unconformable (or a non-sequence at an erosion surface) with chalks of the overlying Gribun Chalk Formation."@en ;
