    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """[Obsolete: use FELL] Massive sandstones, shales, and a few thin coals, with thin limestones and calcareous sandstones.\r
\r
Obsolete term Craighill Sandstone Group is replaced by Fell Sandstone Formation."""@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the base of the Craighill Sandstone Group where sandstone rests conformably upon limestone of the Fell Sandstone Group."@en ;
