    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A series of approximately concordant microdiorite and tonalite sheets, sills or small stocks intruded into an Early Devonian succession of lavas, tuffs and sandstones. Intrusion breccias form a series of pipes along a fault zone. The whole complex has experienced widespread tourmalinisation."@en ;
