    lexicon:hasRockUnitRank <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/RockUnitRank/F> ;
    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "About 8.5 m is attributed to these beds at Caisteal Sloc nam Ban in the Wilderness on Mull."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The upper boundary is conformable with the rest of the Ben Iadain Mudstone Formation (Braley, 1990) or questionably beneath the Clach Alasdair Conglomerate Member (Mortimore, Wood and Gallois, 2001)."@en ;
