    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Very soft, soft to firm sandy/silty clays or muddy sands often laminated, usually olive to dark grey and containing sulphides. The laminae show coarsening upwards sequences. Pockmarks identified on seismic records in some areas."@en ;
