    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Usually unconformable on Palaeozoic rocks. Where conformably overlying the Huntley Formation, base taken where conglomerate or sandstone containing locally derived clasts gives way to sandstones and conglomerates with few such clasts."@en ;
