        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A limestone shale facies comprising a dark grey marine shale sequence. A grit and sandstone facies comprising pale whitish grey fine-grained sandstone and a calcareous sandstone shale facies comprising alternating thinly bedded dark grey fine-grained silty sand with fragmental limestone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the base of the calcareous sandstone shale facies where it rests conformably upon the lagoonal red beds of the Hopcroft Hall Group."@en ;
