    skos:definition "Calcareous sandstone, coarse silicate-sandstone, limestone, mudstone, sand and sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Frasnian Age - to - Famennian Age (Devonian Period) (378.9-359.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "HFM"@en ;
