        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/V"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Deeply weathered sand and gravel and red clay (till). Erratics include both Welsh sandstone boulders (Millstone Grit Group, Namurian) and clasts of Irish Sea provenance (George, 1933)"@en ;
