    skos:broader namedrockunit:SEN ;
    skos:definition "Volcaniclastic-sandstone with subsidiary conglomerate, mudstone, sandstone and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Cautleyan Stage (Ordovician Period) (449.25-448.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
