    skos:broader namedrockunit:SOHI ;
    skos:definition "Gritty psammite, metalimestone, pelite, psammite and semipelite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
