        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SPSCH"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Coarsely foliated, migmatic semipelite and pelite with subordinate striped psammites with bands of calcsilicate rock. Minor amphibolite pods and lenses."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Marked lithological contact with underlying arkosic psammites of the Glenshirra Subgroup, commonly attenuated locally, possibly unconformable."@en ;
