    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """[Obsolete: use MG] \r
\r
Dark grey, blue and black shales with bands of grit, sandstone and quartzite. The sandstones are lenticular."""@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at base of sandstone of the shale group where it rests conformably on shale of the basal grit."@en ;
