    reg:status <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/reg-statuses/deprecated> ;
    skos:altLabel "Millstone Grit Group [See Also MIGR]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Mudstone with subsidiary coarse silicate-sandstone, quartzite and sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Arnsbergian Substage - to - Yeadonian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (327-319 Ma BP)."@en ;
