    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Sandstone, grey-brown to reddish brown to purple, fine- to medium-grained, lithic, locally micaceous, commonly planar bedded, rare sandy siltstone beds, coarsening north-eastwards from Glenny Burn [NN 5700 0213]."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The sharp contact at the top of the Gartartan Conglomerate Member of the Ruchill Flagstone Formation."@en ;
