    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Sequence of organic muds with plant remains and wood. Pollen analysis shows a spectrum with Pinus, Abies, Alnus, Tilia and Corylus (West, 1981)."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The member unconformably overlies chalk rich till."@en ;
