    skos:altLabel "Tarporley Siltstone Formation"@en ;
    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Mudstone, sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary conglomerate and trace gypsum-stone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Anisian Age (Triassic Period) (246.7-241.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
