    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Alternating beds up to 1m thick of conglomerate, very coarse-grained matrix with self-supporting clasts of very well rounded pale greenish grey quartzite and white vein quartz and sandstone, coarse- to very coarse-grained."@en ;
