    skos:definition "Dacitic lapilli-tuff with subsidiary dacitic tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (458.2-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
