    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "6m at Southmead, near Bristol, to 21m in the Tytherington area."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Taken at the junction of crinoidal limestone of the Bed and the oolites of the overlying Gully Oolite Formation. Boundary needs further investigation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/CI> ;
