    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Sandstone, fawn to pale grey, medium- to coarse-grained, micaceous with plant debris; calcareous horizons weathering rusty brown and friable, very fossiliferous and crinoidal."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Not exposed but considered to be conformable with underlying Benbulben Shale Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/CQ> ;
