        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VCBR"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Felsic pyroclastic and extrusive rocks interbedded with shallow water sediments. Lithologies comprise volcanastic breccias, crystal tuffs, porphyritic rhyolitic lavas and thinly interbedded quartzose sandstones, tuffs, lapillistone and mudstone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Not defined - contacts mostly faulted."@en ;
