    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Sharp, undulating, unconformable contact with pale red stony clay diamicton and cobble gravel of the Holmrook Till Member of the Blengdale Glacigenic Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QD> ;
