    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A valley sandur deposit of more-or-less flinty outwash gravels, derived from the Oadby Member (Sumbler, 2001). It grades southwards and, beyond the southern limit of the Moreton Drift, is represented by the Daylesford Member (DAY) of the Upper Thames Valley Formation (on the basis of elevation and clast content)."@en ;
