    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """An area of Worked Ground where the land surface (natural or artificial) has been lowered due to removal of material during the construction of earthworks during an earlier epoch (including prehistoric). The exact nature of the earthworks is unspecified. The English Heritage classification (National Monuments Record Monument Type Thesaurus) is recommended for further subdivision of this type of Archaeological feature. \r
\r
Composition: void."""@en ;
