    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "A sharp upward change in a conformable succession from sandstone to predominantly mudstone. The top of the last sandstone below the Reticulatum-Vallites striolatus (R1c) Marine Band (where identified) or below the coarse-grained and pebbly Addingham Edge Grit."@en ;
