        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/TUF"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Lowest flows are fine-grained microporphyritic pyroxene-andesites and olivine basalts, followed by feldspar phyric basalt and pyroxene andesites. Intercalations between flows include rhyolite and basic tuff, agglomerate and pebbly volcanic grit and tuff."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Conformable: in north east, where pyroxene andesites and olivine basalts overlie biotite rhyolite/dacite of Capelaw Volcanic Member. In south west where, olivine basalts and pyroxene andesites overlie rhyolites and thin lenses of conglomerate of the Bell's Hill Volcanic Member."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent namedrockunit:ALG ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/SO> ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAgeValue 4.227e+02 ;
    lexicon:hasRockUnitRank <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/RockUnitRank/M> ;
    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "At least 366m on Allermuir Hill."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Conformable: where pyroxene andesites, olivine basalts and locally basic tuff and breccia are overlain by rhyolitic tuff and flow-banded rhyolite of the Caerketton Volcanic Member."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/DO> ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAgeValue 4.124e+02 ;
    dcterms:source "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    reg:status <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/reg-statuses/stable> ;
    skos:altLabel "Allermuir Group [Obsolete: use ALMR, CPW]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:PDH ;
    skos:definition "Andesite and basalt with subsidiary agglomerate, basaltic tuff, coarse silicate-sandstone, conglomerate, olivine-basalt, rhyolite and tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Pridoli Epoch (Silurian Period) - to - Lochkovian Age (Devonian Period) (422.7-412.4 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "ALMR"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Allermuir Volcanic Member"@en ;
.

