    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "To 12m"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Sharp, planar or gradational glacitectonic, unconformable contact with a reddish brown, gravelly sandy clay diamicton of the Hatton Till Formation, and elsewhere overlain by yellowish brown, gravelly clayey sand diamictons of the East Grampian Glacigenic Subgroup,  which contain psammite, metagreywacke and granite clasts."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QD> ;
