    skos:definition "Trace appinitic felsite, appinitic ultramafic rock, appinitic-foliated ultramafic rock, dioritic-rock, foliated appinitic felsite, foliated lamprophyre, granodiorite, hornblende diorite, hornblende meladiorite, hornblende melagabbroic-rock, intrusion-breccia, lamprophyre, microgranodiorite, monzonite, olivine melamonzonite, pyroxene diorite and ultramafic-rock. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period - to - Devonian Period (443.1-359.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
