        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A reddish grey to reddish brown, fine- to coarse-grained, commonly poorly sorted, locally massive, locally micaceous, sub-lithic sandstone, with igneous clasts."@en ;
