    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Variable, 150 m at Bracklinn Falls, 350 m at Craig of Port [NN 581 022], but not found south-west of Lake of Menteith, although  it may correlate with a 2 m thick quartz conglomerate in Green Burn [NS 5115 9519]."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Sharp, diachronous contact with sandstone and mudstone facies of the undivided Teith Sandstone Formation."@en ;
