    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The lower boundary is a sharp non-sequential change up from the Brora Coal Bed (BRORC) of the Brora Coal Formation (BOCO) to bioturbated medium-grained sandstone of the Brora Roof Bed (BRORO) of the Cadh'-an-Righ Shale Member (MacLennan and Trewin, 1989)."@en ;
