        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VCSST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A massive, coarse tuff and tuff-breccia, with localised pyroclastic breccia and pebbly volcaniclastic sandstone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Taken at the abrupt change to bedded pyroclastic rocks from either silicic lapilli-tuff of the Whelter Knotts Formation or from bedded volcaniclastic sandstone within the Mardale Formation."@en ;
