    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "0 to 580m generally. Locally up to 820m although this may be tectonically thickened."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Transitional contact into psammites and quartzites of the overlying Inverlair Psammite Formation."@en ;
