    skos:definition "Basalt and hawaiite with subsidiary lapilli-tuff, mugearite and tuff-breccia. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Arundian Substage - to - Asbian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (344.5-330.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "CRRL"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Corrie Lava Member"@en ;
