    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Obsolete: use CEI] Grey to light-grey variably tuffaceous siltstones and sandy siltstones with a scattered shelly fauna. Occasional discontinuous lithic and crystal tuffs and tuffites occur in the upper 50 metres of the formation."@en ;
