    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "0 - 900m in Sheet 55W"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "First appearance of massive pebbly quartzite of Carn Mairg Quartzite Formation within 80m transition zone from impure quartzites and semipelites of Killiecrankie Schist Formation."@en ;
