    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Not known."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The Member is mainly overlain by the Kirkwood Formation of the Strathclyde Group. The contact is considered unconformable with the volcaniclastic sedimentary rocks draping an eroded land surface formed from the Member. Locally (east) it is interbedded with or overlain by the Gowkstane Pyroclastic Member."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/CV> ;
