namedrockunit:DMDI
    a skos:Concept ;
    lexicon:hasBroaderPredominantAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/Q> ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """An area of Disturbed Ground associated with collapse due to the mining of soluble strata by the extraction of natural or artificially introduced mineral-rich groundwater. The disturbance is typically complex, dominated by zones of subsidence, and including areas of Worked Ground and Made Ground. \r
\r
Composition: variable."""@en ;
