    skos:definition "Conglomerate with subsidiary pebbly (gravelly) sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Silurian Period - to - Devonian Period (443.1-359.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "DNCO"@en ;
