        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SEMPEL"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "The Quarff Succession and Melange are tectonic units consisting of Dalradian Supergroup metasedimentary rocks that cannot be allocated to one of the main groups."@en ;
