    skos:definition "Sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary bituminous mudstone and trace limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs both onshore and offshore. Deposited during the Eifelian Age - to - Givetian Age (Devonian Period) (394.3-378.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "DRAY"@en ;
