    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Mainly greyish medium-grained sandstone, locally a coarse-grained subgreywacke varying from dark greenish grey to pale red in colour. Also local thin beds of pebbly sandstone, conglomerate and micaceous sandstone"@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Transitional incoming of a predominantly sandstone succession belonging to the Eastgate Sandstone Member above the Kirk Hill Conglomerate Member of the Westgate Formation"@en ;
