        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/MDST"^^xsd:anyURI ,
        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Moderately thick beds of fine- to medium-grained, poorly to moderately cemented sandstone separated by dark grey-brown, carbonaceous mudstones."@en ;
