    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Dacite with subsidiary volcaniclastic-sandstone and trace basaltic-andesite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Abereiddian Stage - to - Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (468-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
