    skos:broader namedrockunit:CLWYD ;
    skos:definition "Limestone, sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary dolomitic limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Chadian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (346.7-344.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
