    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Silt-laminated mudstone with sparse, scatterd thin sandstone or calcareous sandstone beds."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Taken at the sharp incoming of silt-laminated mudstone of the Felin-wen Formation above the hemipelagic laminated and burrowed mudstone of the Aber Mawr Shales Formation. Base not observed in the Newcastle Emlyn  district."@en ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/OE> ;
