    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Siltstone and wacke with subsidiary conglomerate and mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (458.2-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "GAP"@en ;
