        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SLST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Grey mudstones and siltstone, containing fragmentary plant remains together with thin impersistent limestone beds, seen as a muddy sandstone in the south."@en ;
