    skos:altLabel "Tongue House Member [Obsolete: use LIT, GWD, GY]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:BFA ;
    skos:definition "Dacitic lapilli-tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (458.2-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
