    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Fine-grained pale green ultramafic rocks with abundant tremolitic amphibole, commonly fragmented/brecciated; and some metabasalts, aphyric but rarely pyroxene-phyric. Interbanded with greywacke grits and slaty to phyllitic pelites."@en ;
