    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The upper boundary is conformable at the top of obviously indurated chalks near the base of the Lewes Nodular Chalk Formation (\"Upper Chalk\")  but overlying the Chalk Rock Member. Note that this does not necessarily coincide with the top of the Top Rock."@en ;
