    skos:definition "Basalt lava and basaltic lava with subsidiary hyaloclastite, limestone, mudstone, pillowed basalt lava, sandstone and tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Asbian Substage - to - Brigantian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (337-330.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "KNV"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Kinghorn Volcanic Formation"@en ;
