        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Sandy and shelly siltstones and mudstones with marine fauna, fining upwards as marine conditions deepened to open marine from shallow neritic conditions. Minor indicators of cyclicity, probably due to changing water depths and energy conditions."@en ;
