    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "85.5m. Varies from ca 30m. to over 100 metres in deep erosive features."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Overlain by the Fishes Formation with planar contact though sometimes eroded by pre-Forth or pre-Coal Pit Formation erosive phases. Basal surface is irregular, filling in an eroded topography."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QMIS010> ;
