        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/Z"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Sand and gravel, but also with beds of interbedded clay and silt. Typically about 6 per cent 'fines', 65 per cent sand and 29 per cent gravel."@en ;
