        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SZV"^^xsd:anyURI ,
        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/Z"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Characteristically reddish yellow very silty fine to medium sand with beds of silt or sand. Very sparse fine gravel and limited bands of fine dark detrital material are noted. Lawns House Farm Sand Member is commonly water saturated, supporting a weak hydrostatic head, and prone to \"running\"."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Nowhere exposed; details unknown."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent namedrockunit:CDVY ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QD> ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAgeValue 1.16e-01 ;
