    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "At the appearance of drab brown sandstones of the Brownstones Formation, which on the M4 Motorway Pantmawr cutting [ST 1487 8219] lies 5.6 m from the top of the highest bed of extraformational conglomerate, where the junction is sharply defined."@en ;
