    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Either a conformable contact with the overlying Plumpe Farm Sand Member of the Plumpe Sand and Gravel Formation or a sharp, glacitectonic contact with the overlying Plumpe Bridge Till Member of the Gretna Till Formation."@en ;
