    skos:definition "Quartzite with subsidiary psammite and trace calcsilicate-rock and semipelite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "LOGQ"@en ;
