    skos:altLabel "Ardwell Bridge Lavas [Obsolete: use LYBV]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:BLWR ;
    skos:definition "Amphibolite and lava with subsidiary pelite and wacke. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
