    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base of rhyolitic, lava-like, welded tuff overlies parallel bedded, andesitic tuff (Whorneyside Tuff Formation). Essentially conformable but with angular discordances where the andesitic tuffs are slumped."@en ;
