        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/MIMDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Dark grey/black mudstones of anoxic deposition dominate the succession, which is locally laminated, organic-rich and contains few benthic fossils. Poorly exposed."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Abrupt lithological change from sandstone of the Scalpay Sandstone Formation (SCS) to anoxic mudstone."@en ;
