        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SLST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """The Pinskey Gill Formation comprises grey, vuggy, dolomitic limestone and dolostone interbedded with grey to dark grey calcareous mudstone and thin-bedded, calcareous, silty sandstone. \r
\r
The strata were deposited in a peritidal marine and fluvial environment. \r
\r
Mid Courceyan."""@en ;
