        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/LMOOL"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Cross-bedded fissile sandy ooidal limestone passing to ooidal calcareous mudstone in the Highworth area. Common lignite fragments and bivalves, rare ammonites."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base taken at change up from shelly ooidal limestone (Highworth Limestone Member) into sandy ooidal limestone or ooidal calcareous mudstone of the Pusey Flags Member."@en ;
