        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SLST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Micaceous sandstone and siltstone, red-brown to fawn, flaggy, well-bedded, immature, commonly weathered, soft and friable.  Pebbly beds common near base."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Sedimentary transition into Delnabo Conglomerate Formation."@en ;
