    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Red to brown, angular or subangular, fine- to medium-grained sandstone, generally parallel-bedded, with concentrations of angular Charnian clasts forming matrix-supported conglomerates. Siltstones and mudstones in upper part."@en ;
