    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Biotite granite and potassium feldspar-phyric biotite granite, with a zone of muscovite-quartz rock, interpreted as greisen. Radiometric age: 399 +/- 8 Ma (recalculated using later constants from Shepherd et al., 1976)."@en ;
