    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "NM 3730 9366. Highly variable gradational and/or interdigitating transition into overlying Laimhrig Shale Member, which may occur over several tens of metres of stratigraphical thickness, eg NM 3695 9905."@en ;
