        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/ANDTFF"^^xsd:anyURI ,
        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/ANLTUF"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Andesitic coarse tuffs and lapilli-tuffs; massive to weakly stratified, with a very rough weathered surface exhibiting conspicuous surface holes."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Change from dacitic to acid andesitic tuffs; overlies Lincomb Tarns Tuff Formation."@en ;
