    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "A maximum of 0.3m is exposed at the stratotype locality."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The sand facies of the Trimingham Sand Member is truncated by the till facies of the Weybourne Town Till Member. In places that sands have been sheared and dragged into small isoclinal fold structures."@en ;
