        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Obsolete: use CFML] Thick units of thinly bedded dark argillaceous limestone with shale bands, interbedded with units of pale massive skeletal limestone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Lower contact taken at the first palaeosol below the lowest unit of argillaceous limestone and shale marking the boundary with the underlying Penmon Limestone."@en ;
