    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Obsolete: use BSG] Mainly thinly interbedded dark grey fissile mudstone and weakly calcareous or dolomitic blocky or platy, silty mudstone and siltstone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base of the Cravenoceras leion Marine Band."@en ;
