    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Mudstone, siltstone and silty mudstone with subsidiary sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Pendleian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (330.3-327 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "UBS"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Upper Bowland Shale Formation [Obsolete: use BSG]"@en ;
