        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SLMDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Pale olive-grey argillaceous shelly limestones interbedded with medium olive-grey, bioturbated, shell-detrital silty mudstones. Distinctive fauna includes Rhynchonelloidella wattonensis."@en ;
