    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Basal conglomerate, sandstone and pebbly sandstone with beds of dolomitic siltstone and mudstone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the base of the Dronga Conglomerate and Pebbly Sandstone. Base not seen, or faulted contact."@en ;
