        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/Z"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Sand and gravel, locally with lenses of silt, clay or peat and organic material. It occurs as isolated hill top gravel patches at Woodford, lying at 50 - 80 m above OD."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Rests unconformably on bedrock geology."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent namedrockunit:GSG ;
