    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Andesitic lapilli-tuff, massive."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Taken at the base of the pyroclastic flow deposit, usually overlying volcaniclastic sandstone in the Waberthwaite Formation succession; basaltic sills may intervene."@en ;
