    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Grey rubbly micaceous silty mudstones with siltstone bands, in places orange-stained and weathering shaly."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the base of the Acton Scott Formation where mudstone facies rest conformably on blocky and rubbly mudstones and siltstones of the Cheney Longville Flags."@en ;
