    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "c. 60 m near Church Stretton to c. 150 m in the Caradoc (south) area."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the conformable upward passage of the Acton Scott Formation where the division from the overlying Onny Shales has been based on palaeontological grounds because of difficulty differentiating."@en ;
