    skos:altLabel "Acton Scott Group [Obsolete: use ASGP]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Silty mudstone with subsidiary siltstone and trace limestone and sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Actonian Substage (Ordovician Period) (451.25-450.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
