    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Pyroclastic rocks and related basaltic lavas, mostly alkali olivine-basalts (basanite to hawaiite) and volcaniclastic rocks."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "First occurrence of volcanic rocks above the Two Foot Coal in the West Lothian Oil-Shale Formation."@en ;
