        "Bathgate Lavas [Obsolete: use BHV]"@en ,
        "Bathgate Volcanic Formation [Obsolete: use BHV]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:BATH ;
    skos:definition "Basalt, basaltic pyroclastic-rock, basaltic-rock, lava, olivine-clinopyroxene-microphyric basalt, plagioclase-olivine-clinopyroxene-macrophyric basalt, tuff and volcaniclastic-breccia with subsidiary basaltic tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Asbian Substage - to - Arnsbergian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (337-323.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "BHV"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bathgate Hills Volcanic Formation"@en ;
