    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Clays and silts with occasional thin sands, lime-mudstones and limestones, contains a low diversity brackish and freshwater molluscan fauna often concentrated in seams."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Erosional interburrowed omission surface on underlying Bembridge Limestone Formation overlain by a 3m thick bed of sand packed with oysters of the Bembridge Marls Member."@en ;
