    skos:broader namedrockunit:BACT ;
    skos:definition "Sandstone with subsidiary mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs offshore. Deposited during the Early Triassic Epoch (Triassic Period) (251.9-246.7 Ma BP)."@en ;
