    skos:definition "Pebbly (gravelly) sandstone and sandstone with subsidiary conglomerate, siliciclastic argillaceous rock and siltstone and trace mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Early Triassic Epoch - to - Carnian Age (Triassic Period) (251.9-227.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
