        "Buckie Beds [Obsolete: use BUC]"@en ,
        "Buckie Formation [Obsolete: use BUC]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Limestone with subsidiary mudstone and sandstone and trace quartzite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Early Devonian Epoch - to - Mid Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (419-378.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:isTopConceptOf lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
