    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base of the first grey-green, rubbly mudstones containing comminuted shell debris above mottled green, grey and purple mudstones of Rubery Formation. 1m thick transition in colour and upward decrease in number of hard siltstone beds."@en ;
