    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Alternations of structureless reddish brown mudstone and laminated greenish grey and reddish brown mudstones. NOTE: The contact between the Byley Mudstones and overlying Wych Mudstones is not currently shown on British Geological Survey maps, and they have been mapped as one division."@en ;
