        "Bryn Brith Beds [Obsolete: use BYN]"@en ,
        "Bryn Brith Grits [Obsolete: use BYN]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:CREN ;
    skos:definition "Mafic tuff and tuffite with subsidiary tuffaceous-sandstone and trace mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Abereiddian Stage (Ordovician Period) (468-461.25 Ma BP)."@en ;
