    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Phyllitic semipelite and pelite, represented by andalusite-cordierite schist in part with rare quartzite and psammite."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Above Blackwater Formation at base of highly magnetic biotite-andalusite-schist easily mapped and/or traced by magnetometer between NJ 405 312 and NJ 441 351 (the Garnel Burn Pelite Member)."@en ;
