        "Kymah Quartzite Formation"@en ,
        "Upper part of Durn Hill Quartzite [Obsolete: use DBDQ]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:DBIS ;
    skos:definition "Quartzite with subsidiary psammite and trace gritty psammite, metadiamictite, micaceous psammite and semipelite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "DBDQ"@en ;
