    skos:broader namedrockunit:LNK ;
    skos:definition "Andesite, basalt, basaltic-andesite and lava with subsidiary pyroclastic-rock, tuff, volcaniclastic-breccia and volcaniclastic-sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Early Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (419-394.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:narrower
        namedrockunit:BNHS ,
