    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Micaceous siltstones and mudstones with subsidiary sandstone and limestone bands. Variable basal limestone (Dolhir Limestone Member) to fissile mudstone (Tyn-y-Twmpath Member). Formation has rich shelly (brachiopod) fauna. Includes Corwen Grit Member at top of formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Unconformable on various Caradoc Formations."@en ;
