    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Sand and gravel containing clasts of Carboniferous lithologies (sandstone, gritty sandstone, limestone, mudstone, gannister, coal), including far-travelled clasts from Scotland and the Lake District (greywacke sandstone and siltstone, granite and granodiorite)."@en ;
