    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Conglomerate."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The Finavon Conglomerate was originally thought to conformably overlie the Melgund Formation (Armstrong and Paterson, 1970, p.14), however, it has since been determined to be a lens-shaped body within the Tannadice Sandstone Member, rendering the Melgund Sandstone Member superfluous."@en ;
