    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Obsolete: use AG] Variable sequence of thinly interbedded dark grey to black limestone, shaly mudstone and subordinate sandstone. Limestones richly fossiliferous in places with coral-brachiopod fauna. A bed containing abundent algal nodules 'Girvanella Nodular Bed' commonly occurs just above the base."@en ;
