    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Up to about 15 m."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The Haddicoe Sand and Gravel Member is generally at the surface, but is locally overlain in valleys by Head, and on the lowermost ground by silt and peat of the Breydon Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QA> ;
