    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Mainly sandstone, grey, quartzitic, clean, parallel-laminated, with inter-bedded cross-laminated units and some mudstone interbeds. Ladder ripples and reactivation surfaces are present. Local channels filled with flaser and lenticular beds. Trace fossil Arenicolites and Tentaculitids."@en ;
