    skos:definition "Volcaniclastic-mudstone and volcaniclastic-sedimentary-rock with subsidiary tuff and trace conglomerate, mudstone, sandstone, sedimentary rock based on grain size or crystal size and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Asbian Substage - to - Brigantian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (337-330.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
