    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Gabbro, microgabbro and dolerite, with subordinate microgranite, microdiorite, rhyolite; and intrusive breccia."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Includes all mafic plutonic intrusions in the Lake District of proved and inferred Ordovician age which includes the Carrock Fell Complex (CFCO) and the Haweswater Intrusions (HAWS)."@en ;
