    skos:broader namedrockunit:HBX ;
    skos:definition "Conglomerate with subsidiary sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Arenig Series - to - Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (477.1-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
