        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SLST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Cross-bedded sandstones, pebbly sandstones and conglomerates with subordinate siltstone and mudstone beds.   Records fluvial deposition along the margin of the North Wales Dinantian platform throughout the late Asbian."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Rests unconformably on ?Devonian, Ordovician and Precambrian rocks (Mona Complex)."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
