    skos:definition "Basalt and tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Brigantian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (330.9-330.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
