        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SLST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A pale grey, thin to thick-bedded quartz arenite sandstonr, peripheral parts with interbedded laminated mudstone and siltstone"@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The stratigraphical with the Lonan Formation at the base, is marked by a change from a mudstone-dominated facies to a sandstone-dominated facies"@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
