    skos:definition "Amphibolite and hornblende schist and trace garnet-hornblende schist, glaucophane schist, metadolerite, metaorthopyroxenite, metapyroxenite, psammite, serpentinite, talc-rock and ultramafic-rock. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
