    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The North Denes Formation rests unconformably mostly on the silts, clays and sands of the Breydon Formation, but also on the sands and gravels of the Crag Group, and to a lesser extent on the glacigenic deposits of the Happisburgh Formation."@en ;
