    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Variable, but dominantly marls or clays, with thin beds of micritic limestone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Upward change from either dominantly micritic limestones of the Wockley Member, or fine-grained oolites of the Chilmark Member, to marls and clays. In sections, base taken below lowest \"Dirt Bed\"; in the field, micritic limestone above the Dirt Bed is probably mapped with the underlying Member. "@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
        namedrockunit:H2963 ,
