    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Greyish brown to dark grey, slightly fissured, laminated, soft (0.2-2cm varves) silt and clay with rare fine sand layers. Horizons of fine-grained sand to 1m thick occur within the unit."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Observed in boreholes, this unit rests on either a sand and gravel lag deposit or directly on bedrock."@en ;
