    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Pale, greenish-grey mudstones, darker in uppermost 3m with thin beds of dark grey sandy limestone. The formation records the accumulation of alluvial and lagoonal (restricted marine) muds along the local margin of the North Wales Dinantian platform."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Rests unconformably on Ordovician mudstones and tuffaceous sandstones of the Allt-tair-ffynnon Formation."@en ;
