    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Thin- to medium-bedded, fine- to medium-grained skeletal wackestone and packstone with stylolitic mudstone partings and interbeds. Coarser crinoidal lithologies occur in lower part and form basal lags of graded and cross-stratified packstone beds that are common in upper part. The limestone is typically dark grey and foetid."@en ;
