    skos:broader namedrockunit:DBCN ;
    skos:definition "Pelite, psammite and semipelite with subsidiary metalimestone and quartzite and trace calcsilicate-rock, metasedimentary rock based on grain size or crystal size and micaceous psammite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:narrower namedrockunit:BCMB ;
