    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Grey or brown, calcareous, sandy, stony diamicton containing significant proportion of locally-derived Carboniferous rocks (mainly limestone, sandstone and mudstone)."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Generally unconformable on bedrock"@en ;
