    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Highly variable, locally in excess of 5m."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The ground surface or locally unconformably overlain by stiff, red, clay-rich diamicton (Dee Member of Bowen 1999) of the Stockport Glacigenic Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QD> ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAgeValue 1.18e-02 ;
