    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Mostly grey, fissile or blocky, fossiliferous calcareous mudstones; a few limestones."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Placed at the base of mudstones resting on the highest limestone of the underlying Wilmcote Limestone. Placed at top of Bed 26 at type section (Donovan, 1956)."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
