    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The base is clearly seen on the foreshore below Close-ny-Clollagh Point [SC 245 671], where volcaniclastic tuffs rest with a sharp, baked contact on underlying claystones of the Bowland Shale Formation."@en ;
