    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Dark grey laminated organic-rich shaly mudstone and dark grey mudstones with sporadic concretionary and tabular limestone bands. Abundant vertically oriented fibrous calcite of diagenetic origin ('Beef')."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base of bed 50, of Lang, W D, et al, 1923. Taken at sharp lithological change from limestone-shale interbeds of the Blue Lias Formation, to predominantly shales. Conformable boundary."@en ;
