    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "The term Skerry Group was introduced by Ritchie et al. (1996) for a succession of Lower Jurassic shallow marine deposits within the North Rona Basin that lie below the Humber Group. The Skerry Group comprises the Stack Skerry and Sule Skerry formations."@en ;
