    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A dark greenish grey, locally purplish grey, basalt, variably amygdaloidal or compact, locally doleritic, in part autobrecciated."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Basalt lava of the Shacklow Wood Lava Member is underlain by pale and medium grey limestone of the Monsal Dale Limestone Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
        namedrockunit:H4353 ,
