    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Poorly sorted green fine-to coarse-grained basaltic calcareous tuffs with subordinate agglomerates and recrystallised carbonate-rich basaltic lavas. A few thin pink limestones occur scattered throughout the Formation."@en ;
