        "Basal Sandstone Unit [Obsolete: use VIFM]"@en ,
        "Carboniferous Limestone [Obsolete: use CL, PKLM, CLWYD, PEMB, BOHI, HOHI, TRLI]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Breccia, conglomerate, pebbly (gravelly) sandstone and sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Late Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) - to - Tournaisian Age (Carboniferous Period) (378.9-346.7 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:isTopConceptOf lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
