    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Obsolete: use COB] Dominant green sandstones, subordinate red siltstones and rare conglomerates and dolomitic rocks. In the upper parts comprising fine-grained to very coarse-grained sandstones with subordinate conglomerates."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the base of the Clee Sandstone Formation where it conformably rests upon the Abdon Limestone Formation."@en ;
