    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Purple and green slaty mudstone and siltstone with thin to medium beds of grey green sandstones and sporadic packets of pale grey quartzite sandstone beds. Local mottling and blebbing due to bioturbation, dispersed sedimentary clasts and volcanic detritus."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base not seen on Sheet 348 or elsewhere in southwest England."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
        namedrockunit:DRTM ,
        namedrockunit:DTMS ;
