    skos:definition "Mudstone and siltstone with subsidiary quartzite and sandstone and trace volcaniclastic rocks (both pyroclastic and reworked volcanic rocks). Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Lochkovian Age - to - Pragian Age (Devonian Period) (419-410.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "WTD"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Whitsand Bay Formation"@en ;
