    skos:definition "Clay, sand and silt with subsidiary gravel, peat and sandy gravel. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Devensian Stage - to - Holocene Epoch (Quaternary Period) (.116-0 Ma BP)."@en ;
