    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Maximum thickness exceeds 810m in east Fife"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The conformable top of the Formation lies in a transitional sequence to the Pittenweem Formation and is taken at the base of the Cuniger Rock Marine Band."@en ;
