    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Sandstone, siltstone, mudstone, limestone and conglomerate; highly fossiliferous in places (shelly faunas)."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Coincides with lower boundary of the Balclatchie Formation (on coastal outcrops) and lower boundary of the Craighead Limestone Formation (in the Craighead Inlier)."@en ;
