        "Serw Formation [Obsolete: use BGL, RBVO]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:AVG ;
    skos:definition "Crystal tuff with subsidiary mafic lava, mudstone and siltstone and trace felsic tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Llanvirn Series - to - Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (468-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
