        "Upper Jurassic Sand Formation [Obsolete: use BRAE]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:HMBG ;
    skos:definition "Conglomerate and sandstone with subsidiary breccia and mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs offshore. Deposited during the Kimmeridgian Age - to - Tithonian Age (Jurassic Period) (154.8-143.1 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "BRAE"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Brae Formation"@en ;
