    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Lies within the purple sandstones and mudstones of the Synalds Formation. Base is taken at the sharp base of the \"Andesitic Ash\", a distinctive purple and green coarse-grained tuff bed about 130m below the top of the Synalds Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
