    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the conformable upward passage of calcitic mudstones of the Clifton Down Limestone to fossiliferous, massive, grey crinoidal and oolitic bioclastic limestone of the Hotwells Limestone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/CQ> ;
