        "Santon Oolite Member [Obsolete: use CML, SNO]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Limestone with subsidiary calcareous mudstone and calcareous siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Bajocian Age (Jurassic Period) (170.9-168.2 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
