    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Attains 175-200m at Green Craig on Allermuir Hill. Thins southwards to less than 80m at Capelaw Hill."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Conformable: where biotite dacite or biotite rhyolite is overlain by basic andesites and olivine basalts of the Allermuir Volcanic Member."@en ;
