        "Capelaw Volcanic Formation [Obsolete: use CPW]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:PDH ;
    skos:definition "Andesite, basalt, dacite and rhyolite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Pridoli Epoch (Silurian Period) - to - Lochkovian Age (Devonian Period) (422.7-412.4 Ma BP)."@en ;
