        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SEMPEL"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Mostly semipelite and pelite with beds of metalimestone, some thick and massive. Minor beds of calc-silicate rock and quartzite."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base of dark pelites and semipelites overlying paler calcareous, banded phyllitic semipelites and psammites of the Tarnash Phyllite and Limestone Formation. (Base not seen in type section.)"@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
        namedrockunit:DASG ,
