    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "700m maximum (based on outcrop width and average dip), >160m on coast at Sandend Bay."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Top of dark pelites and semipelites beneath Durn Hill Quartzite Formation. (Top not seen in type or reference sections.)"@en ;
