    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The base is placed at the base of silica-cemented (\"quartzitic\") sandstone or conglomerate where it rests with sharp base on an erosion surface cut in the underlying Gilwern Clay Member of the Llanelly Formation."@en ;
