    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "To 12m (maximum at Blaen Onneu Quarry [SO 155 169]."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The top is placed at the top of the silica-cemented (\"quartzitic\") sandstone, where it is sharply and unconformably overlain by the basal limestone of the Dowlais Limestone Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/CJ> ;
