        "Kentmere Pike Rhyolites [Obsolete: use GSD, KMR]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:BVG ;
    skos:definition "Dacitic lapilli-tuff with subsidiary dacitic tuff and trace volcaniclastic-sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (458.2-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "KMR"@en ;
