    skos:altLabel "Leny Grit (in part) [Obsolete: use KWG]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:SOHI ;
    skos:definition "Coarse silicate-sandstone with subsidiary limestone, metamudstone and slate and trace chert and metasandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Ediacaran Period (Precambrian) - to - Comley Series (Cambrian Period) (635-508 Ma BP)."@en ;
