    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Gradational passage taken at the transition from limestone-dominated beds to calcareous mudstone and nodular limestone beds of the overlying Nodular Member."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/SH> ;
