        "Lower Limestone Shales [Obsolete: use LSH]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Mudstone and ooid-limestone with subsidiary limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Courceyan Substage (Carboniferous Period) (359.3-346.7 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "LSH"@en ;
