    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Laminated, bituminous, silty, argillaceous dolostone with an unusually high concentration of metallic minerals and a distinctive fish fauna."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Sharp, unconformable contact on either the aeolian Yellow Sands Formation or on Carboniferous, usually Coal Measures, strata: represents a rapid marine transgression with the incoming of marine, bituminous, silty, argillaceous dolostone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent namedrockunit:H1067 ;
