    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """[Obsolete: use EDY] \r
\r
Fluvial, aeolian and sabkha sediments overlying the lacustrine flagstones of the Caithness Flagstone Group. NOTE: Composite of formational type sections in northern Caithness and Orkney. Various cliff sections in the Orkney Islands."""@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base of the predominantly fluvial sandstones that cut across the top of the lacustrine flagstones."@en ;
