        "Hoy Sandstone Group [Obsolete: use HOY, OYS]"@en ,
        "Old Red Sandstone, Upper [Obsolete: use OYS]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Non-carbonate salt-rock and sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Mid Devonian Epoch - to - Late Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (394.3-359.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "OYS"@en ;
