    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Conglomerate, matrix supported; matrix of grey-brown, dolomitic or calcareous sandstone with rounded to angular grey, green, purple or red clasts of mudstone, sandstone, ironstone, limestone and less common igneous and metamorphic rocks."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Sharp; unconformable on reddened Carboniferous rocks."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
