        "Portland Sand [Obsolete: use POSA, PLS, PSND, WAR]"@en ,
        "Upper Lydite Bed [Obsolete: use PSND]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Sand and sandstone with subsidiary calcareous mudstone, conglomerate and mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Tithonian Age (Jurassic Period) (149.2-143.1 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
