    skos:definition "Quartzite with subsidiary metalimestone, muscovite-rich pelite, pelite and semipelite and trace gneissose pelite, psammite and schistose pelite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
