    skos:definition "Sandstone and wacke with subsidiary mudstone and siltstone and trace limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Pusgillian Stage - to - Cautleyan Stage (Ordovician Period) (449.75-448.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
