    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "To 245m. Commonly absent."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Overlain by sharp base of Grassington Grit, Brennand Grit or Warley Wise Grit; commonly an unconformity."@en ;
