    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Diamicton, brown to reddish-brown with stones and matrix derived primarily from Upper Carboniferous and Triassic rocks; subordinate sand, gravel and stoneless clay and silt.Red pebbly clay and silty clay with rock fragments - [generic description: 'TMOS' Procedures]."@en ;
