        "Bracklinn Falls Conglomerate Member"@en ,
        "Uamh Bheag Conglomerate Formation [Obsolete: use UBCO]"@en ,
        "Uamh Bheag Conglomerate [Obsolete: use UBCO]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:THF ;
    skos:definition "Conglomerate with subsidiary pebbly (gravelly) sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Emsian Age (Devonian Period) (410.5-394.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "UBCO"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Uamh Bheag Conglomerate Member"@en ;
.

