    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Base of pale grey silty calcareous mudstone with sporadic limestone nodules of the overlying Lower, Middle and Upper Elton formations (undifferentiated). These are equivalent to Lower Ludlow Shales."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/SH> ;
