    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Obsolete: use AG] A rhythmic sequence of limestones, shales and mudstones, siltstones and sandstones, with seatearths and coals."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the base of the Callant Limestone Formation where it rests conformably upon the Lower Liddesdale Group."@en ;
