    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Limestone, mudstone, sandstone and siltstone and trace coal and seat-earth mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Brigantian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (330.9-330.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
