    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Grey, laminated and massive, silty clay and silt. Gravelly shoreline deposits and sandy deltaic deposits are present locally (Cave and Hains, 2001). Likely to contain dropstones and interbedded thin diamictons at depth."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Unconformable on bedrock and Plynlimon Glacigenic Formation. Laterally it might interdigitate with head deposits."@en ;
