    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Likely to be in excess of 10 m. A railway cutting at [SO 1696 9105] exposes 7 m of sand and fine gravel."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Generally the ground surface or unconformable contact with Holocene alluvial deposits of the Severn and Avon Catchments Subgroup."@en ;
