        "Applethwaite Series [Obsolete: use AP]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:KKB ;
    skos:definition "Calcareous siltstone with subsidiary shelly sandstone and trace limestone and mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Cautleyan Stage (Ordovician Period) (449.25-448.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
