    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Comprises a red conglomerate that contains clasts mainly of Moine Supergroup metasedimentary rocks and granite, and thin interbeds of sandstone."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Unconformable on Moine metasedimentary rocks, which are mainly composed of migmatitic pelite and semipelite of the Loch Coire Formation, together with granitic sheets known as the Badenloch granite sheets, of the Caledonian Igneous Supersuite."@en ;
