    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Represents the deposits of the second terrace of the Kennet valley on BGS maps. Gravel, variably sandy and clayey."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Sharp erosional base on Cretaceous-Tertiary bedrock."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
