    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Up to about 4m thickness."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition " A generally sharp, erosive boundary with cross-bedded shell-fragmental ooidal limestone or mudstone of the Forest Marble Formation."@en ;
