    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Duricrust is an indurated product of surface and near-surface processes formed by cementation or replacement of bedrock, weathering deposits, unconsolidated sediments, soil or other materials produced by low-temperature physiochemical processes."@en ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/Q> ;
