    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Pluton composed of 3 main facies of grey to pink-grey, medium to coarse-grained granodiorite and monzogranite, abundant enclaves of metasediment. Minor small bodies of green-grey diorite and monzodiorite. Aplitic microgranite veins."@en ;
