    skos:broader namedrockunit:ANHGR ;
    skos:definition "Granodiorite with subsidiary monzogranite and trace aplitic microgranite, diorite, granite and monzodiorite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period - to - Early Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (443.1-394.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
