    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """[Obsolete: use ABSG, MRCG] \r
\r
Sands and gravels (including pebbly sands and sandy gravels), some clayey or silty with some silts and clays. The distal (seaward) portions include marine shells."""@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Rests unconformably on bedrock or on older (mostly glacial) Quaternary deposits."@en ;
