    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "0 to c. 10 m."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Contact with pebbly, silty, sandy clays and clayey sands of the Crowland Bed (Booth, 1982), or unconformably overlain by Flandrian deposits. In the absence of the Crowland Bed, the distal portions of the Fen Gravel may not be separable from the lowest Flandrian deposits."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QD> ;
