        "Fen-Margin Gravel [Obsolete: use FEG]"@en ,
        "March Gravels Member"@en ,
        "March Gravels, Abbey Sand And Gravel,First Terrace Deposits,Etc."@en ;
    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Gravel with subsidiary sand and trace clay and silt. Superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Devensian Stage (Quaternary Period) (.116-.0118 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "FEG"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fen gravel [Obsolete: use ABSG, MRCG]"@en ;
