        "Bruar Psammite Formation [Obsolete: use GCKP]"@en ,
        "Drumocter Succession [Obsolete: use GCKP]"@en ,
        "Moine \"Series\" [Obsolete: use GCKP, LNES]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:STEL ;
    skos:definition "Feldspathic psammite and quartzose psammite with subsidiary micaceous psammite and semipelite and trace calcsilicate-rock and quartzite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:narrower namedrockunit:ABIP ;
    skos:notation "GCKP"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Gaick Psammite Formation"@en ;
