    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "A pale grey mudstone, with a variable proportion of siltstone laminae and sandstone dispersed in thin; sandstone locally predominant in thin to thick-bedded packets; siltstone, massive, dominant locally; minor occurences of andesitic tuff and volcanic breccia"@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Faulted."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
