    skos:broader namedrockunit:CBY ;
    skos:definition "Breccia, mudstone, sandstone, volcaniclastic-sandstone and wacke. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (458.2-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
