        "Holt Heath Sand and Gravel [Obsolete: use HHSG]"@en ,
        "Third (Main) Terrace of the Severn [Obsolete: use HHSG]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:SEVN ;
    skos:definition "Gravel and sand. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Wolstonian Stage (Quaternary Period) (.362-.126 Ma BP)."@en ;
