    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Pale-weathered, stratified sequence of garnetiferous silicic tuff, lapilli-tuff and pyroclastic breccia with intercalated volcaniclastic sedimentary rocks. Includes dacite (Scafell Dacite) and rhyolite (Rosthwaite) lavas."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Base of diverse sequence of tufflapilli-tuff that usually unconformably overlies the Crinkle Tuff Member (high-grade rhyolitic tuff) in the Airy's Bridge Tuff Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
        namedrockunit:H2908 ,
        namedrockunit:NPN ;
