    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "14.28m in the type section."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The upper boundary is taken at a prominent bedding plane above Inoceramus-rich chalk with tabular flint, where it is overlain by chalk of the Ballymagarry Chalk Formation"@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/KC> ;
