    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Up to c. 8 m."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Conformable contact between interbedded limestone, calcareous mudstone and calcareous siltstone of the Raventhorpe Beds and the mudstone-rich succession of the overlying Kirton Cementstone Beds or with peloidal and ooidal limestone of the Santon Oolite (where present)."@en ;
