        "Raventhorpe Member plus Santon Oolite Member (part) [Obsolete: use RVB]"@en ,
        "Santon Oolite [Obsolete: use LLL]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Obsolete name. Calcareous mudstone, calcareous siltstone and limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Bajocian Age (Jurassic Period) (170.9-168.2 Ma BP)."@en ;
