        "Skipwith Common Sand Member [Obsolete: use SKIS]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:BREI ;
    skos:definition "Sand with subsidiary gravelly clayey sand and trace sandy clayey peat. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Devensian Stage (Quaternary Period) (.116-.0118 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:narrower
