    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Sandstone is overlain sharply by mudstones with marine fauna (Crossdale Mudstone) including Isohomoceras subglobosum Marine Band in Crossdale Beck."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/CG> ;
