        "Snettisham Clay Formation [Obsolete: use SNC]"@en ,
        "Snettisham Clay [Obsolete: use SNC]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:DEB ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone and trace ferruginous mudstone and sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Barremian Age (Cretaceous Period) (126.5-121.4 Ma BP)."@en ;
