    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Total thickness (from NG 4230 0014 to NG 3270 0200) of c.2000m +/- 500m (allowing for uncertainty in fault displacements)."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Overlain by the Leac Nam Faoileann Member (TCAF) on Soay; overlain by the Sgorr Mhor Sandstone Member (TCSM) on Rum. Marked by the disappearance of 'exotic' pebbles."@en ;
