        "Llyn Cau Mudstones [Obsolete: use TYGN]"@en ,
        "Llyn-Y-Gadair Mudstones [Obsolete: use TYGN]"@en ,
        "Ty'r Gawen Formation [Obsolete: use TYGN]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:OGW ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone with subsidiary sandstone, siltstone and tuffaceous-mudstone and trace ooid-ironstone, tuffaceous-sandstone and tuffaceous-siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Caradoc Series (Ordovician Period) (458.2-449.75 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
