        "Swindale Shale Formation [Obsolete: use AHL]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:DNT ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone and silty mudstone with subsidiary siltstone and trace sandstone and tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Rawtheyan Stage - to - Hirnantian Age (Ordovician Period) (448.75-443.1 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:narrower
        namedrockunit:CYO ,
