    skos:definition "Tuffaceous-sandstone and tuffaceous-siltstone with subsidiary volcaniclastic-sandstone and trace tuff and volcaniclastic-breccia. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Ediacaran Period (Precambrian) (635-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
