    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "120m to greater than 350m"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Not generally seen as faulted against the Devono-Carboniferous in the Dunbar area. In the St Abb's area, it is overlain by Eyemouth Volcanic Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/D> ;
