    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Locally unconformably overlying Lewisian Gneiss, inferred to be uncomformable over the Wester Ross Supergroup. Commonly the base is formed by the Sgurr Beag Thrust or associated ductile thrusts."@en ;
