    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Graphitic kyanite-bearing semipelite merges with 1m of transitional muscovitic, rusty-weathering  quartzite with graphitic seams which forms the base of the Meall Dubh Quartzite Formation. This  transitional quartzite is possibly equivalent to the Beinn a'Ghlo Transition of Smith, R A and Harris, A L (1976)."@en ;
