    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Mudstone and siltstone with thin beds of limestone and dolomite; sandstone is subordinate; pattern of sedimentation cyclic with non-marine origin dominant over marine."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The conformable base of the Formation lies in a transitional sequence up from the Anstruther Formation and is drawn at the base of the Cuniger Rock Marine Band."@en ;
