    skos:definition "Mudstone, sandstone and siltstone and trace coal, dolomitic limestone, ironstone and limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Asbian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (337-330.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
