    skos:definition "Mudstone with subsidiary chert, limestone and sandstone and trace basalt and pillowed basalt lava. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Eifelian Age (Devonian Period) (394.3-385.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
