    skos:definition "Conglomerate and sandstone with subsidiary siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Wenlock Epoch (Silurian Period) (432.9-426.7 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
