    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Obsolete: use FANT, FRFA, LGY, MEST, PANT, PDW] Purple and green shales, interstratified with bands of purplish or grey limestone, red, yellow and white sandstone and red marl. Conglomerates locally."@en ;
