    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The upper boundary is unconformable at an erosion surface with the younger Kilcoan Sands Formation, the so-called Turonian non-sequence within the Hibernian Greensands Group; and also beneath the erosion surface at the base of the Ulster White Limestone Group at basin margins."@en ;
