    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Rhyolitic and dacitic lavas, basaltic pillow lavas. Spilitic breccias, acid tuffs and intercalated volcaniclastic sediments. Correlative of Fishguard Volcanic Group-Llanrian Volcanic Group."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at base of rhyolitic and dacitic lavas of the Porth Maen Melyn Volcanic Formation where it rests conformably on dark mudstones of the Aber Mawr Shale Formation."@en ;
