    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at the base of welded ash-flow tuffs of the Padarn Tuff Formation (base not exposed). (Correlative of Padarn Tuff Formation = Bwlch Gwyn Felsite, Anglesey)."@en ;
