    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Drawn at conformable upward passage from siltstone and sandstone of the Fachwen Formation (east of Aber-Dinlle Fault) or tuff and tuffite of the Bangor Formation (west of Aber-Dinlle Fault) to purple-red siltstone of the Llanberis Slates Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/E> ;
