    skos:definition "Clay and siliciclastic argillaceous rock with subsidiary sand, sandstone and silt and trace lignite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Eocene Epoch - to - Oligocene Epoch (Palaeogene Period) (56-23.04 Ma BP)."@en ;
