    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "At upward transition (usually sharp) into Edlington Formation or, farther east in the subsurface, the Hayton Anhydrite."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/PUL> ;
