        "Thanet Formation, Lambeth Group and Harwich Formation (Undifferentiated)"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:THAM ;
    skos:definition "Glauconitic sand and sand with subsidiary clay and silt and trace ash, calcilutite and gravel. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Ypresian Age (Palaeogene Period) (56-48.1 Ma BP)."@en ;
