    skos:broader namedrockunit:SOHI ;
    skos:definition "Metawacke, psammite and semipelite with subsidiary pebbly psammite and pelite and trace calcareous pelite, calcareous psammite, calcareous semipelite, calcsilicate-rock, conglomerate, gritty psammite, hornfelsed pelite, hornfelsed semipelite, hornfelsed-micaceous psammite [obsolete code: use pshm] and micaceous psammite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) (1000-541 Ma BP)."@en ;
