    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Silty mudstones with dark burrow mottles. Several thick units of laminated hemipelagite. Scattered packets with thin sandstones. Thick unit of interbedded conglomerates, sandstones, pebbly mudstones and mudstones known as Doldowlodd Conglomerate (Member) locally present."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Gradational incoming of sequence, dominated by burrow mottled mudstones, above the black laminated mudstones of the St Cynllo's Church Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent namedrockunit:H4815 ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/OA> ;
