    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Conglomerate, shale, sandstone and siltstone, with intercalated andesitic and rhyolitic lava and ash, and thin chert bands. Comprises entire Old Red Sandstone of Bogie outlier, and possibly also the Cabrach outlier."@en ;
