        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/MDST"^^xsd:anyURI ,
        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Thinly interbedded green and grey turbidite mudstones and burrowed hemipelagites. Sparse thin packets of thinly interbedded turbidite mudstones and laminated hemipelagites. Scattered thin packets with turbidite sandstones. NOTE: Overlain by the Caeran Mudstones and underlain by the Derwenlas Formation. Locally underlain by the Caban Conglomerate Complex."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Taken at base of a prominent thick packet of thinly interbedded turbidite mudstones and laminated hemipelagites overlying thinly interbedded turbidite mudstones and burrowed hemipelagites of the Derwenlas Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
        namedrockunit:CSF ,
