    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "The unit is composed of two ophiolitic nappes, the upper and lower nappes, which are separated and underlain by imbricate zones composed of metasedimentary strata, including ophiolitic erosional debris, acid and basic metavolcanic rocks, ophiolitic rocks and hornblende schist."@en ;
