    skos:definition "Metabasaltic-rock, metadolerite, metadunite, metaharzburgite, metamicrogabbro, quartz-albite rock, quartz-albite-phyric felsite and talc-rock. Bedrock. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Neoproterozoic Era (Precambrian) - to - Silurian Period (1000-419 Ma BP)."@en ;
