    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "60 to 130m"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Is overlain by the mudstones of the Llanengan Formation. The sharp contact with the latter is a transgressive boundary, possibly a non-sequence, with a horizon of phosphatic conglomerate at the top of the St Tudwals Formation. (Machroes Member)."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/OR> ;
