    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Unconformity; transgression of marine, Late Permian, Zechstein Group strata; usually the Marl Slate Formation but locally where this is absent, over palaeotopographic highs or as a result of syndepositional slumping, the younger Raisby and Ford formations."@en ;
