    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Where undivided the Aylesbeare Mudstone rests on red-brown sandstone of the Dawlish Sandstone, possibly unconformably. See Clyst St Lawrence Formation and Exmouth Mudstone and Sandstone Formation for definition of base where those formations are present."@en ;
