    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Highest member of the formation, the Ederny Limestone Member, is overlain disconformably by the normal Bundoran Shale Formation or the sandstone basal member in the Kesh-Omagh area and southwest County Fermanagh."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/CJ> ;
