    skos:definition "Sandstone with subsidiary mudstone and siltstone and trace ironstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Langsettian Substage - to - Bolsovian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (319-310 Ma BP)."@en ;
