        "Upper Carstone [Obsolete: use CA]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Ferruginous sandstone and sandstone with subsidiary conglomerate, glauconitic sandstone and pisoidal sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Albian Age (Cretaceous Period) (113.2-100.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:isTopConceptOf lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:notation "CA"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Carstone Formation"@en ;
