        "Johnshaven and Rouen Formations [Obsolete: use CATC]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:ATGK ;
    skos:definition "Conglomerate with subsidiary sandstone and volcaniclastic-sandstone and trace andesite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Lochkovian Age - to - Pragian Age (Devonian Period) (419-410.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:narrower
        namedrockunit:BACO ,
