    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Grey to maroon medium-grained sandstone, glauconitic in upper part. Mudstone present only as rare beds 0.10m thick, or as drapes to sandstone beds."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Sharp unconformable contact of coarse beds on weathered tuffaceous Precambrian rocks of the Caldecote Volcanic Formation. Basal beds are red breccias or grey conglomerates."@en ;
