        "Dawlish sandstones and breccias [Obsolete: use DAS]"@en ,
        "Lower Sandstone [Obsolete: use DAS, THSA]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:EXE ;
    skos:definition "Sand and sandstone with subsidiary breccia and mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Permian Period (298.9-251.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
