    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Gravels with subsidiary sands, clays and silts."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "A sharp planar unconformity, resting on bedrock of Triassic - Palaeogene age or the Crag Group (Pliocene - Pleistocene). Deposits of the Dunwich Group also interdigitate with those of the Crag Group."@en ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QP> ;
