    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "Up to 15 m."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Most commonly overlain by deposits of the Albion Glacigenic Group, from which it can be distinguished by the presence of northern-British derived errratics in the Albion Glacigenic Group. It is less commonly overlain by deposits of the Britannia Catchments Group or British Coastal Deposits Group."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/QP> ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAgeValue 1.18e-02 ;
