    skos:definition "Mudstone with subsidiary gypsum-stone, sandstone and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Anisian Age - to - Ladinian Age (Triassic Period) (246.7-237 Ma BP)."@en ;
