    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Thinly laminated to very thinly bedded dark grey siltstones and mudstones, local lenticular units of ithic wacke; underlain by greywackes of the Loweswater Fromation; overlain by the volcaniclastic Eycott Volcanic Group."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Taken above the uppermost thin sandstone of the underlying Loweswater Formation on Whiteside End."@en ;
