    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "[Olistostrome] Grey slaty mudstone with framework and matrix breccias/conglomerates, interbedded sandstone, felsic and mafic tuffs/lavas and metamorphic rock breccias. Olistoliths of Ordovician quartzite, Silurian and early to mid Devonian limestone, sandstone, breccia, metamorphic and mafic/ultramafic igneous rocks."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "No details yet provided."@en ;
