    skos:definition "Mudstone and siltstone with subsidiary limestone and sandstone and trace calcilutite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Hettangian Age - to - Pliensbachian Age (Jurassic Period) (201.4-184.2 Ma BP)."@en ;
