        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/SDST"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """The group comprises a sandstone-mudstone dominated succession and is defined by the four formations: \r
Leckenby Formation; \r
Hudleston Formation; \r
Strangways Formation; \r
Wroot Formation."""@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The lower boundary is defined by the base of the Wroot Formation."@en ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/JA> ;
