    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Non sequential; base of lowest limestone (commonly sandy) of the Inferior Oolite Group resting on sand/silt or mudstone (as in the Lithological Description), or on \"(Cotswold) Cephalopod Bed\" (sandy and argillaceous, ironshot commonly fossiliferous limestone) in the Worcester Basin area."@en ;
