        "Yeovil Sands [Obsolete: use BDS]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:LI ;
    skos:definition "Sand and sandstone with subsidiary mudstone, silt and siltstone and trace limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs both onshore and offshore. Deposited during the Toarcian Age (Jurassic Period) (184.2-174.7 Ma BP)."@en ;
