    skos:broader namedrockunit:PIPR ;
    skos:definition "Sandstone with subsidiary mudstone and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs offshore. Deposited during the Kimmeridgian Age (Jurassic Period) (154.8-149.2 Ma BP)."@en ;
