    skos:broader namedrockunit:COME ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone, sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary coal, seat-earth mudstone and seat-earth sandstone and trace ganister and ironstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Langsettian Substage - to - Asturian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (319-307.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
