        "Laurencekirk Mudstone Formation [Obsolete: use CXF]"@en ,
        "Sannox Siltstone Formation"@en ,
        "Sannox Siltstones [Obsolete: use SXS]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:SEG ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone and siltstone with subsidiary sandstone and silty mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Emsian Age (Devonian Period) (410.5-394.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
