        "Avon Second Terrace (Deposits) [Obsolete: use WAT]"@en ,
        "Bretford Sand and Gravel Member and Wasperton Sand and Gravel Member (Undifferentiated) (Warwickshire Avon)"@en ,
        "No.2 Terrace (Deposits) [Obsolete: use WAT]"@en ,
