        "Kirk Hill Conglomerate [Obsolete: use KKH, WGAT]"@en ,
        "Newside Arenite [Obsolete: use NWA, CARM, WGAT]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:CARM ;
    skos:definition "Conglomerate and sandstone with subsidiary quartz-wacke. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Llandovery Epoch - to - Wenlock Epoch (Silurian Period) (443.1-426.7 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
