        "Trefor Limestone Formation [Obsolete: use CFML]"@en ,
        "Upper Grey Limestone [Obsolete: use CFML]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:CLWYD ;
    skos:definition "Limestone and mudstone and trace chert and sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Asbian Substage - to - Brigantian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (337-330.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
