    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "1097m (Evans, 1922). 1350m (Lane, 1965). 1658m (Tuunbridge, 1978). 2000-2500m (Edmonds et al. 1985)."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Commonly faulted but probably conformable with Ilfracombe Slates."@en ;
