    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "21m in the type section with general range of 0 - 100m in west and south Cumbria."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Taken at the base of the overlying red clastic sequence (St. Bees Shales) where red mudstones become predominant over evaporites."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/PUL> ;
