    skos:definition "Anhydrite-stone with subsidiary dolostone, mudstone and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs both onshore and offshore. Deposited during the Guadalupian Epoch - to - Lopingian Epoch (Permian Period) (274.4-251.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
