        "Lower Dolomite Formation [Obsolete: use FPL, BHL, BRL]"@en ,
        "Penmaen Burrows Limestone Formation [Obsolete: use BRL, BHL, FPL]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:PEMB ;
    skos:definition "Limestone with subsidiary dolostone and trace chert, mudstone and tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Courceyan Substage - to - Chadian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (359.3-344.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
