        "Meadfoot Grits [Obsolete: use MDT]"@en ,
        "Meadfoot Series [Obsolete: use MDT]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Sandstone, siltstone and slate with subsidiary limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Pragian Age - to - Emsian Age (Devonian Period) (412.4-394.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:isTopConceptOf lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
