    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "River terrace gravels, sands and associated organic sediments. The Arun has seven river terrace aggradations above the alluvium (e.g. Sheet 301 Haslemere, BGS, 1981). Pleistocene to Holocene (MIS pre-13 - 1)."@en ;
