    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Downward change from the chalks of the Chalk Group and the calcareous and chalky mudstones, of the Svarte Formation of the Shetland Group, to the Rødby Formation at the top of the Cromer Knoll Group."@en ;
    lexicon:hasYoungestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/KE> ;
