    reg:status <https://linked.data.gov.au/def/reg-statuses/stable> ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone, sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs both onshore and offshore. Deposited during the Berriasian Age - to - Cenomanian Age (Cretaceous Period) (143.1-93.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
