    skos:definition "Mudstone with subsidiary conglomerate and sandstone and trace agglomerate, coal and tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Westphalian Stage (Carboniferous Period) (319-307.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
