        "Corton Formation [Obsolete: use HPGL]"@en ,
        "Cromer Till [Obsolete: use BRLA, HPGL, LOFT, SMCL]"@en ,
        "North Sea Drift Formation [Obsolete: use HPGL, OVSD, SMCL]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:ALBI ;
    skos:definition "Diamicton, sand and sandy gravel with subsidiary laminated clay and silt. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Pleistocene Epoch (Quaternary Period) (2.58-.0118 Ma BP)."@en ;
