        "North Sea Drift Formation [Obsolete: use HPGL, OVSD, SMCL]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:ALBI ;
    skos:definition "Clay, diamicton, sand and silt with subsidiary gravel and gravelly sand. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Pleistocene Epoch (Quaternary Period) (2.58-.0118 Ma BP)."@en ;
