    skos:definition "Mudstone and siltstone with subsidiary calcilutite and limestone and trace calcareous sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs both onshore and offshore. Deposited during the Toarcian Age (Jurassic Period) (184.2-174.7 Ma BP)."@en ;
