        "Upper Keuper Marl [Obsolete: use BCMU]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:MMG ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone and siltstone with subsidiary gypsum-stone and trace sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Norian Age - to - Rhaetian Age (Triassic Period) (227.3-201.4 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:narrower
