    skos:broader namedrockunit:ISCG ;
    skos:definition "Gravel and sand with subsidiary diamicton and trace clay and silt. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Devensian Stage (Quaternary Period) (.116-.0118 Ma BP)."@en ;
