        "Portscatho Beds [Obsolete: use GRO, PORO]"@en ,
        "Veryan Limestone [Obsolete: use GRO, PWER]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Sandstone and slate with subsidiary breccia, mudstone and siltstone and trace lava and tuff. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Eifelian Age - to - Frasnian Age (Devonian Period) (394.3-371.1 Ma BP)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:isTopConceptOf lexicon:NamedRockUnit ;
    skos:narrower
        namedrockunit:CRNE ,
