    skos:definition "Mudstone, sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary coal, dolomitic limestone, ironstone, olivine-macrophyric basalt, plagioclase-olivine-clinopyroxene-macrophyric basalt, seat-earth sandstone and tuff and trace pebbly (gravelly) sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Chadian Substage - to - Holkerian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (346.7-337 Ma BP)."@en ;
