    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "In type area, at top of Frodingham Ironstone (Gaunt, G D, Fletcher, T P and Wood, C J, 1992); elsewhere, at erosive base of thin pebbly ferruginous oolite (Glebe Farm Bed), which marks the base of the Charmouth Mudstone Formation."@en ;
