    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "To 900m"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Taken where grey mudstone with subordinate limestone, siltstone and sandstone, passes up into the pale olive and blue-grey to cream-coloured porcellanous mottled wackestone, of the Hodderense Limestone Formation."@en ;
