    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Stratigraphical boundaries not seen, the top is probably unconformiable with the Dalby Group against which exposed contacts are elsewhere faulted. It is distinguished by a change from a mudstone-dominated facies in the Manx Group to a sandstone-dominated facies in Dalby Group."@en ;
