    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Dominantly glacial till (clay, sandy clay and clayey sand with gravel and boulders) with interbedded sand, gravel and laminated clay, plus more substantial areas of those individual lithologies incorporated in the till sheet, moraines and eskers."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Unconformable on bedrock or older superficial deposits including previous valley deposits, outwash deposits and laminated clays formed in front of the advancing glacier."@en ;
