    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "To about 50m on moraines and eskers, generally 10-30m"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "Varies between the present land surface and the contact with later deposits such as glacial lake deposits, outwash and blown sand."@en ;
