    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The top is placed at the base of the Brithdir Coal, where the coal overlies thin mudstone/seatearth at the top of the Member and is overlain by lithic ('Pennant') sandstone and thin siltstone/mudstone of the Brithdir Member."@en ;
