        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/VFLY"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription """[Obsolete] \r
\r
Flint pebbles, sub-angular, with clasts of rounded flint, sarsen sandstone, vein quartz, in a clay-rich quartz matrix; fluviatile in origin, laid down on erosional shelves. [Generic description: 1:50 k map margins]."""@en ;
    lexicon:hasOldestAge <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/Q> ;
