        "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/WACKE"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Laminated siltstone and mudstone with sporadic greywacke beds and one thick sequence of greywackes (Loweswater Formation), overlain by the Eycott Volcanic Group of volcanic and sedimentary rocks. Base of Skiddaw Group not seen."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Not seen."@en ;
    lexicon:hasObsoleteEquivalent
