    skos:definition "Metamudstone and siltstone with subsidiary mudstone, sandstone and wacke. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Tremadoc Series - to - Llanvirn Series (Ordovician Period) (486.5-458.2 Ma BP)."@en ;
