    skos:definition "Limestone, mudstone, sandstone and siltstone and trace coal. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Holkerian Substage - to - Yeadonian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (343-319 Ma BP)."@en ;
