    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription """About 120 m in the Hampshire Basin. \r
\r
Up to about 140 m in the London Basin."""@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition """In the Hampshire Basin, as for the Selsey Sand Formation. \r
\r
In the London Basin, the Camberley Sand Formation is the youngest Palaeogene unit."""@en ;
