    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "Southern faulted boundary: Laurieston Fault. Stratigraphical lower boundary with underlying Moffat Shale Group [of Ordovician to Silurian (gracilis to sedwickii biozones) age.]"@en ;
