    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Semipelite and pelite, much of it graphitic; interbedded with limestone units, the lower limestones typically graphitic, the uppermost typically dolomitic"@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "At top of Ballachulish Subgroup; generally at the transition from banded semipelite and limestone to more graphitic pelite with limestone beds."@en ;
