    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "c.300 to 600m (but locally tectonically thinned to 50m)"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "At base of Islay Subgroup; generally transitional over a few metres where pale dolomitic limestone passes into psammite or quartzite with beds or larger units of diamictite."@en ;
