    skos:definition "Calcareous mudstone, limestone and mudstone with subsidiary chert, mudmound limestone, sandstone and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Chadian Substage - to - Yeadonian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (346.7-319 Ma BP)."@en ;
