        "Middle and Upper Chalk Undivided [Obsolete: use WHCK]"@en ,
        "Sussex White Chalk Formation [Obsolete: use WHCK]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:CK ;
    skos:definition "Chalk with subsidiary calcareous mudstone and flint. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Cenomanian Age - to - Maastrichtian Age (Cretaceous Period) (100.5-66 Ma BP)."@en ;
