    skos:definition "Calcareous mudstone, limestone, mudstone and ooid-limestone with subsidiary calcareous sandstone and sandy limestone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs both onshore and offshore. Deposited during the Bajocian Age - to - Callovian Age (Jurassic Period) (170.9-161.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
