    skos:broader namedrockunit:WLO ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone and sandstone with subsidiary basalt, calcareous mudstone, coal, dolostone, lapilli-tuff, lava, limestone and sapropelite. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Asbian Substage - to - Brigantian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (337-330.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
