    skos:broader namedrockunit:CL ;
    skos:definition "Limestone with subsidiary dolomitic limestone and sandstone and trace chert, coal, mudmound limestone and mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Courceyan Substage - to - Brigantian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (359.3-330.3 Ma BP)."@en ;
