    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "c.500-1100m (but locally tectonically thinned to 100m)"@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "At base of Blair Atholl Subgroup: generally at the transition from banded semipelite and limestone to more graphitic pelite with limestone beds."@en ;
