    skos:broader namedrockunit:GBG ;
    skos:definition "Clay, gravel, sand and silt with subsidiary peat and trace diamicton. Stratified superficial deposits. Occurs onshore. Formed during the Pliocene Epoch (Neogene Period) - to - Holocene Epoch (Quaternary Period) (5.33-0 Ma BP)."@en ;
