        "Lias Group (formerly Lias) [Obsolete: use LI]"@en ,
        "Lias [Obsolete: use LI]"@en ,
        "Lyas [Obsolete: use LI]"@en ;
    skos:definition "Calcareous mudstone, mudstone and silty mudstone with subsidiary calcilutite and trace ironstone, limestone, sandstone and siltstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs both onshore and offshore. Deposited during the Rhaetian Age (Triassic Period) - to - Aalenian Age (Jurassic Period) (205.7-170.9 Ma BP)."@en ;
