    skos:broader namedrockunit:PCM ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone, sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary coal and seat-earth mudstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Bolsovian Substage - to - Asturian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (314.75-307.5 Ma BP)."@en ;
