    lexicon:hasLithologyDescription "Grey, (productive) coal-bearing mudstones/siltstones, with seatearths and minor sandstones."@en ;
    lexicon:hasLowerBoundaryDefinition "The base is taken at the base of the Subcrenatum Marine Band (as defined by Stubblefield and Trotter, 1957), where marine, fossiliferous mudstones at the base of the marine band conformably overlie the topmost mudstones or sandstones of the Marros Group. The Formation rests unconformably on Dinantian or Devonian strata in the Berkshire and Kent coalfields."@en ;
