    lexicon:hasThicknessDescription "c. 80 m on the east crop of the South Wales Coalfield to c. 300 m in the Swansea area."@en ;
    lexicon:hasUpperBoundaryDefinition "The top is taken at the base of the Vanderbeckei (Amman) Marine Band (as defined by Stubblefield and Trotter, 1957), where basal fossiliferous, marine mudstone of the marine band comformably overlies the top of the Amman Rider Coal (and its equivalents)."@en ;
