    skos:altLabel
        "Lower Coal Measures (Scotland) [Obsolete: use LCMS]"@en ,
        "Lower Coal Measures Formation [Obsolete: use PLCM, SWLCM, LCMS]"@en ,
        "Productive Coal Measures (Part) [Obsolete: use LCMS]"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:CMSC ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone, sandstone, siliciclastic argillaceous rock and siltstone with subsidiary cannel-coal, carbonaceous ironstone, clay-ironstone, coal, seat-earth mudstone, seat-earth sandstone and shelly ironstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Langsettian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (319-318 Ma BP)."@en ;
