        "Pennine Lower Coal Measures Formation and South Wales Lower Coal Measures Formation (Undifferentiated)"@en ;
    skos:broader namedrockunit:PCM ;
    skos:definition "Mudstone, sandstone and siltstone with subsidiary coal, ironstone and seat-earth mudstone and trace ganister and seat-earth sandstone. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Langsettian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (319-318 Ma BP)."@en ;
